      "text": "his life is bound up in the lad’s life, Gen. 44:30. thou shalt bind them for a sign, Deut. 6:8. they bound him with two new cords, Judg. 15:13. He healeth the broken in heart, and bindeth up their wounds, Ps. 147:3. mercy and truth … bind them about thy neck, Prov. 3:3. Bind them continually upon thine heart, Prov. 6:21. Bind them upon thy fingers, Prov. 7:3. Bind up the testimony, Isa. 8:16 (2 Ne. 18:16). in the day that the Lord bindeth up the breach, Isa. 30:26. sent me to bind up the brokenhearted, Isa. 61:1. bind up that which was broken, Ezek. 34:16.",
